{
  "title": "Ziyarate Janabe Hur (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْعَبْدُ الصَّالِحُ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha al`abdu alssalihu\nPeace be upon you, O righteous servant,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْمُجَاهِدُ النَّاصِحُ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha almujahidu alnnasihu\npeace be upon you, O striver, the sincere advisor,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَنْ وَفیٰ بِالسَّعَادَۃِ الرَّابِحَۃِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya man wafa bilssa`adati alrrabihati\npeace be upon you, O one who attained profitable happiness,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَنْ نَكَثَ بَیْعَتَ یَزِیْدَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya man nakatha bay`ata yazida\npeace be upon you, O one who broke his allegiance to Yazid,\nوَ فَدیٰ بِرُوْحِهٖ لِلْحُسَیْنِ الشَّهِیْدِ\nwa fada biruhihi lilhusayni alshshahidi\nand sacrificed his soul for al-Husain the martyr,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْبَطَلُ الصَّنْدِیْدُ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha albatalu alssandidu\npeace be upon you, O the mighty, valiant hero,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْفَارِسُ الشُّجَاعُ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha alfarisu alshshuja`u\npeace be upon you, O the brave horseman,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْبَطَلُ الْمَنَّاعُ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha albatalu almanna`u\npeace be upon you, O the staunch, defending hero,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَنْ تَرَكَ الطُّغْیَانَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya man taraka altughyana\npeace be upon you, O one who abandoned tyranny,\nوَ اَطَاعَ الْوَاحِدَ الدَّیَّانَ\nwa ata`a alwahida alddayyana\nand obeyed the One, the Requiter,\nوَ دَخَلَ فِیْ طَاعَتِ الرَّحْمٰنِ\nwa dakhala fi ta`ati alrrahmani\nand entered into obedience to the All-Merciful,\nوَ فَدیٰ بِرُوْحِهٖ لِلْحُسَیْنِ الشَّهِیْدِ الْغَرِیْبِ الْعَطْشَانِ\nwa fada biruhihi lilhusayni alshshahidi alghharibi al`atshani\nand sacrificed his soul for al-Husain, the martyr, the stranger, the thirsty one,\nوَ صَالَ عَلَی الْعُدْوَانِ\nwa sala `ala al`udwani\nand charged against the aggression (of the enemy),\nوَ هُوَ صَرِیْعاً عَلَی التِّرْبَانِ\nwa huwa sari`an `ala altturbani\nwhile lying slain upon the dust,\nوَ خُطِیَ بِالْخُلْدِ وَالْجِنَانِ\nwa khutiya bilkhuldi waljinani\nand was betrothed to eternity and the Gardens of Paradise.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حُرُّ الشَّهِیْدِ الرِّیَاحِیْ\nalssalamu `alayka ya hurru alshshahidu alrriyahi\nPeace be upon you, O Hurr, the martyr, al-Riyahi,\nوَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ بَرَكَاتُهٗ۔\nwa rahmatu allahi barakatuhu\nand Allah’s mercy and His blessings."
}
